35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Transport is 38% of costs if we go far. That is huge.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Inland clubs slept eight to a room. Lights out at eleven.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,Public bookings are a lottery. The application is nine pages.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Public beds are 1,100 yen a night. That is cheaper than I thought.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Seniors say mixing only happens if we sleep in the same place.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, does the 1,100 yen include equipment?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, is the lottery really that difficult?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, if dates shift, you resubmit everything. It is risky.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Yes, hall and equipment are folded into the charge.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, did the inland clubs have good training sessions?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we stay local, transport is only 9% of the cost.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,The attendance sheets show a fifth never came to away camps.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,Cooking duty took two hours a day last year. That is a lot.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need to be careful with the budget gap from last year.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,Our own hall is booked by three other clubs during vacation.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,So staying local saves money but might not mix groups well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,Sleeping badly ruins the final day's performance. We need quality.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I do not want to spend the camp on duty again.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need a place with kitchen staff if possible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"If we use our own hall, we train in early mornings and late evenings.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
