64,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option C is two prefectures away. Option A is inland.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, what are the quoting terms for Option C?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
