67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, the lottery is risky. Option C has fixed headcount.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,Option C has non-refundable deposits. That is a financial risk.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
