70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"If someone drops out of Option C, the rest pay for them.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,Option A has enforced lights out. That might help sleep quality.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,Option B means commuting for some. That is hard for early trains.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"Option A is the cheapest per night. 1,100 yen.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Takumi,,Option C allows whole-building lets. That might help mixing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I am leaning towards Option A for the budget.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shion,,I am worried about the sleep quality in Option A.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I prefer Option C to avoid cooking duty.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I need to see the full cost of Option C before deciding.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Takumi,,I think Option C is best for year-group mixing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
